{"seq":3,"slug":"self-supervised-speech","title":"自监督语音表示学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-recognition-asr/deep-learning-asr/self-supervised-speech","wordCount":2083,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"自监督语音表示学习\">自监督语音表示学习</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>自监督学习（SSL）</strong>：从无标注音频中通过预设任务（掩蔽预测、对比学习）学习通用语音表示，下游任务仅需少量标注即可微调</li>\n<li><strong>wav2vec 2.0</strong>：对比学习范式的奠基模型，通过掩蔽+量化+对比损失从原始波形学习表示</li>\n<li><strong>HuBERT</strong>：通过迭代聚类产生伪标签，将预训练转化为 BERT 式掩蔽预测任务</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"自监督学习的动机与核心思想\">自监督学习的动机与核心思想</h2><p>语音领域标注数据的获取代价极高——一小时精确转录通常需要 4-10 小时的人工标注。而互联网上存在海量无标注音频（播客、广播、视频），自监督学习（Self-Supervised Learning, SSL）的核心思想是从这些无标注数据中学习通用语音表示，使得下游任务仅需少量标注即可达到优异性能。</p>\n<p>SSL 在语音领域的影响可类比 BERT 对 NLP 的变革：模型通过设计巧妙的预训练任务（pretext task）从数据结构本身提取监督信号，学习到的表示在多种下游任务（ASR、说话人识别、情感检测、语音分离）上具有强迁移能力。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[海量无标注音频] --&gt; B[自监督预训练]&#10;    B --&gt; C[通用语音表示]&#10;    C --&gt; D[ASR 微调]&#10;    C --&gt; E[说话人识别]&#10;    C --&gt; F[情感检测]&#10;    C --&gt; G[语音分离]&#10;    H[少量标注数据] --&gt; D&#10;    H --&gt; E&#10;    H --&gt; F\">graph TD\n    A[海量无标注音频] --&gt; B[自监督预训练]\n    B --&gt; C[通用语音表示]\n    C --&gt; D[ASR 微调]\n    C --&gt; E[说话人识别]\n    C --&gt; F[情感检测]\n    C --&gt; G[语音分离]\n    H[少量标注数据] --&gt; D\n    H --&gt; E\n    H --&gt; F</pre><p>SSL 模型的三大范式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>范式</th>\n<th>预训练目标</th>\n<th>代表模型</th>\n<th>核心思想</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>对比学习</td>\n<td>区分正负样本</td>\n<td>wav2vec 2.0, XLSR</td>\n<td>预测掩蔽位置的量化表示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预测学习</td>\n<td>预测离散标签</td>\n<td>HuBERT, data2vec</td>\n<td>预测聚类伪标签</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>去噪/重建</td>\n<td>重建掩蔽输入</td>\n<td>WavLM, BEST-RQ</td>\n<td>从损坏输入恢复原始表示</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"wav2vec-2-0-对比学习范式\">wav2vec 2.0：对比学习范式</h2><p>wav2vec 2.0（Meta AI, 2020）奠定了语音 SSL 的基础架构，由三个核心组件构成：</p>\n<p><strong>特征编码器（Feature Encoder）</strong>：7 层 1D 卷积网络，将 16kHz 原始波形（每 20ms 一帧）转换为潜在声学表示 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这一步类似传统的特征提取，但完全可学习。</p>\n<p><strong>上下文网络（Context Network）</strong>：12/24 层 Transformer 编码器，将潜在表示 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 编码为上下文化表示 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。训练时随机掩蔽约 50% 的时间步。</p>\n<p><strong>量化模块（Quantization Module）</strong>：将潜在表示 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 通过 Gumbel-Softmax 离散化为 codebook 条目 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，每帧从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 个 codebook 中各选一个 code（产品量化）。</p>\n<p><strong>对比损失</strong>：在掩蔽位置，模型需要从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 个干扰项（同 batch 内其他位置的量化表示）中识别出正确的量化目标：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>sim</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>sim</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>q</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L} = -\\log \\frac{\\exp(\\text{sim}(c_t, q_t)/\\tau)}{\\sum_{k=1}^{K} \\exp(\\text{sim}(c_t, \\tilde{q}_k)/\\tau)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5979em;vertical-align:-1.1709em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1288em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9812em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sim</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sim</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1709em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>加上多样性损失（diversity loss）鼓励 codebook 的均匀使用。</p>\n<p>wav2vec 2.0 在 LibriSpeech 上用仅 10 分钟标注数据微调即达到 4.8% WER，展示了 SSL 预训练的惊人效率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"hubert-迭代聚类预测\">HuBERT：迭代聚类预测</h2><p>HuBERT（Hidden-Unit BERT, Meta AI, 2021）提出了不同于对比学习的预训练策略——通过离线聚类产生伪标签，将预训练转化为掩蔽预测任务：</p>\n<p><strong>第一轮训练</strong>：对 MFCC 特征做 K-means 聚类（如 K=100），产生帧级伪标签。模型在掩蔽位置预测这些伪标签（交叉熵损失）。</p>\n<p><strong>迭代优化</strong>：用第一轮训练后模型中间层的表示重新做 K-means 聚类（K=500），产生更高质量的伪标签。用新标签重新训练模型。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[MFCC 特征] --&gt; B[K-means K=100]&#10;    B --&gt; C[伪标签 Round 1]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Masked Prediction 训练]&#10;    D --&gt; E[模型中间层表示]&#10;    E --&gt; F[K-means K=500]&#10;    F --&gt; G[伪标签 Round 2]&#10;    G --&gt; H[Masked Prediction 训练]&#10;    H --&gt; I[最终 HuBERT 模型]\">graph LR\n    A[MFCC 特征] --&gt; B[K-means K=100]\n    B --&gt; C[伪标签 Round 1]\n    C --&gt; D[Masked Prediction 训练]\n    D --&gt; E[模型中间层表示]\n    E --&gt; F[K-means K=500]\n    F --&gt; G[伪标签 Round 2]\n    G --&gt; H[Masked Prediction 训练]\n    H --&gt; I[最终 HuBERT 模型]</pre><p>HuBERT 的关键洞察：预训练的目标质量不需要完美——即使聚类标签有噪声，BERT 式的掩蔽预测训练仍能学到有意义的表示。这是因为模型被迫从未掩蔽的上下文推断掩蔽位置的内容，这一过程本身就要求学习语音的结构性规律。</p>\n<p>HuBERT Base/Large 分别在 960h/60,000h 数据上预训练，在 SUPERB benchmark 的多数任务上超越 wav2vec 2.0。</p>\n<h2 id=\"wavlm-全栈语音模型\">WavLM：全栈语音模型</h2><p>WavLM（Microsoft, 2021）在 HuBERT 基础上进行了两项关键增强：</p>\n<p><strong>去噪预训练</strong>：训练数据中混入噪声和重叠语音，模型仍需预测原始干净语音的伪标签。这迫使模型学习分离和去噪能力，使其在下游任务（特别是说话人相关任务和噪声鲁棒 ASR）上表现更好。</p>\n<p><strong>门控相对位置偏差</strong>：改进了位置编码的设计，对不同注意力头使用独立的相对位置偏差，并通过门控机制自适应调节位置信息的贡献。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>预训练数据</th>\n<th>参数量</th>\n<th>SUPERB ASR (WER)</th>\n<th>说话人验证 (EER)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>wav2vec 2.0 Base</td>\n<td>LS-960h</td>\n<td>95M</td>\n<td>6.43%</td>\n<td>6.02%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HuBERT Base</td>\n<td>LS-960h</td>\n<td>95M</td>\n<td>6.42%</td>\n<td>5.11%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WavLM Base</td>\n<td>LS-960h</td>\n<td>95M</td>\n<td>6.21%</td>\n<td>4.69%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WavLM Base+</td>\n<td>LS-960h + VoxPopuli</td>\n<td>95M</td>\n<td>5.74%</td>\n<td>4.07%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WavLM Large</td>\n<td>94kh 混合</td>\n<td>316M</td>\n<td>3.44%</td>\n<td>2.65%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>WavLM Large 在 SUPERB benchmark 几乎所有任务上取得最优，特别是在说话人分离和语音增强任务上优势明显——这归功于其去噪预训练策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"大规模多语言-ssl\">大规模多语言 SSL</h2><p>将 SSL 扩展到多语言场景的代表性工作：</p>\n<p><strong>XLS-R（Meta AI）</strong>：在 128 种语言、43.6 万小时数据上预训练的 wav2vec 2.0 模型（0.3B-2B 参数）。跨语言迁移能力强——在高资源语言上预训练的表示可有效迁移到低资源语言的 ASR 任务。</p>\n<p><strong>USM（Google Universal Speech Model）</strong>：在 1200 万小时、300+ 语言的数据上预训练，采用混合 SSL 策略（BEST-RQ + BERT masking）。USM 支持 ASR、AST（语音翻译）、语言识别等多任务，是 Google 语音产品的统一底座。</p>\n<p><strong>mHuBERT / XLSR-53</strong>：专注于多语言语音表示的对齐，使不同语言共享相近的表示空间，便于跨语言迁移和零样本适配。</p>\n<h2 id=\"微调策略与实践\">微调策略与实践</h2><p>SSL 模型的下游应用通常采用微调（fine-tuning）将通用表示适配到具体任务：</p>\n<p><strong>全参数微调</strong>：解冻所有层，用 CTC loss 端到端训练。学习率通常设为预训练的 1/10（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 \\times 10^{-5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），避免破坏预训练表示。对于 ASR 任务，在模型顶部添加线性投影层映射到词汇表大小。</p>\n<p><strong>分层冻结</strong>：底层固定（保留通用声学特征），仅微调顶层（适配任务特定语义）。研究表明底层主要编码声学/音素信息，顶层主要编码语义/说话人信息。</p>\n<p><strong>Adapter 微调</strong>：在 Transformer 层间插入小规模 adapter 模块（bottleneck MLP），仅训练 adapter 参数（约 5% 总参数），保持预训练权重不变。适合多任务/多语言场景下的高效适配。</p>\n<p><strong>LoRA</strong>：低秩适配，对注意力矩阵的更新施加低秩约束 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta W = BA</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>，进一步减少微调参数量。</p>\n<p><strong>加权层聚合（Weighted Sum）</strong>：不同任务可能需要不同层的信息。可学习的层权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 对所有层输出加权求和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>l</mi></msub><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><msup><mi>h</mi><mi>l</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_l \\alpha_l h^l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1488em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 作为最终表示，让模型自动选择最优的信息融合方式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2026-年-ssl-前沿\">2026 年 SSL 前沿</h2><p>当前语音 SSL 的前沿方向包括：</p>\n<p><strong>更大规模预训练</strong>：数据量从千小时级扩展到百万小时级（USM 1200 万小时），配合数十亿参数模型。NVIDIA Canary-Qwen 2.5B 以 5.63% 平均 WER 位列开源榜首。</p>\n<p><strong>多模态 SSL</strong>：将语音与文本的表示空间对齐（如 SpeechGPT、SALMONN），使同一模型同时理解语音和文本。</p>\n<p><strong>离散化语音 token</strong>：将连续语音表示量化为离散 token（如 SpeechTokenizer、EnCodec），使其可被 LLM 直接处理，催生语音-文本统一建模。</p>\n<p><strong>效率优化</strong>：distillation（Distil-Whisper 将 1.55B 压缩到 756M，WER 仅损失 1%）、pruning、量化等技术使大模型可在消费级硬件上运行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>自监督语音表示学习彻底改变了 ASR 的数据需求格局——从需要数万小时标注数据降低到仅需数小时即可达到优异精度。wav2vec 2.0 开创了对比学习范式，HuBERT 提出了迭代聚类预测策略，WavLM 通过去噪预训练实现了全栈语音理解能力。2026 年的前沿方向是更大规模的多语言预训练、语音-文本表示空间对齐、以及离散化语音 token 使 LLM 可直接处理语音。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p>相关文档：<a href=\"end-to-end-models\">端到端语音识别模型</a> 提供了 CTC/Attention/RNN-T 等框架的基础知识，是理解 SSL 模型微调策略的前提。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自监督语音表示学习","id":"自监督语音表示学习"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"自监督学习的动机与核心思想","id":"自监督学习的动机与核心思想"},{"level":2,"text":"wav2vec 2.0：对比学习范式","id":"wav2vec-2-0-对比学习范式"},{"level":2,"text":"HuBERT：迭代聚类预测","id":"hubert-迭代聚类预测"},{"level":2,"text":"WavLM：全栈语音模型","id":"wavlm-全栈语音模型"},{"level":2,"text":"大规模多语言 SSL","id":"大规模多语言-ssl"},{"level":2,"text":"微调策略与实践","id":"微调策略与实践"},{"level":2,"text":"2026 年 SSL 前沿","id":"2026-年-ssl-前沿"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Transformer ASR 编码器架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-recognition-asr/deep-learning-asr/transformer-asr"},"next":{"title":"流式语音识别系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-recognition-asr/production/streaming-asr"}}